thy, and its error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, payments-worker), which paged on-call. It records that v3.4.0 was the bad deploy, that payments-api is erroring as a knock-on effect, and that the worker was rolled back to v3.3.0.\n- **payments-api:** When I checked right after the rollback, it was still unhealthy on v5.1.0 with an 18% error rate. It may just need time to recover, for example while retries or queued work clear. But its own v5.1.0 release is also marked degraded, so it may have a separate problem.\n\nI haven't touched payments-api. If its errors don't drop over the next few minutes, I can roll it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release, and add that to INC-0001. Just say the word.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Y2zSRKepkerVk3uJkcBfy8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DYf9wmvYga9SUGx3pAA4wr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.85}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SvvZVhuMSrySwSY4Gvu2C7", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.8}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017QM88aYxyAovTLNT8sU51H", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019f44t8Sp1JFuJ34iHL54qk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signatu